================================================================================
unp4k / unforge
================================================================================

The Data.p4k archive reader and DataForge-to-XML converter in src/engine/
are a C++ port of the unp4k and unforge tools from
https://github.com/dolkensp/unp4k by Peter Dolkens and contributors, and of
Osiris DevWorks' parallelized fork
(https://github.com/Osiris-DevWorks/odw-fast-unp4k).

